{"id": "unknown-2026-11-13-029", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["leading"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Baltic Exchange and Mercuria await verdict in landmark tanker index trial", "content": "<p>One of shipping&#8217;s most consequential legal battles has concluded in London, with the Baltic Exchange and commodities trader Mercuria awaiting a High Court ruling on whether the industry&#8217;s leading VLCC freight benchmark should have continued operating after war erupted in the Middle East. The three-week trial ended yesterday, with judgment expected to take several months. &#8230;</p>\n</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "splash247", "url": "https://splash247.com/baltic-exchange-and-mercuria-await-verdict-in-landmark-tanker-index-trial/", "type": "rss"}]}
